# v1.17: the Calendar pane in the side drawer. A tap on a day opens that
# day's note under journal/, creating it with a dated heading; Today and
# Previous / Next step between notes; Settings -> Journal -> Folder layout
# refiles the notes.
# Run with an empty notes folder: `SIGMA_NOTES=$(mktemp -d) scripts/sim.sh
# --headless tests/emu/v1.17-journal.script docs/screenshots/v1.17`.
today 2026-11-02
open-fixture tests/emu/fixtures/markdown-tour.md
tap-on Panels
tap-on Calendar
shot v1.17-journal-menu
tap-on Panels
shot v1.17-journal-calendar
# A day with no note yet: tapping it creates the note and opens it.
tap-on Day:2026-11-02
expect-file journal/2026-11-02.md
expect-file-contains journal/2026-11-02.md|# Monday, 2 November 2026
expect-open journal/2026-11-02.md
shot v1.17-journal-today
# Notes on other days, then walk between them.
tap-on Day:2026-11-05
expect-file journal/2026-11-05.md
expect-file-contains journal/2026-11-05.md|# Thursday, 5 November 2026
tap-on Day:2026-11-12
expect-file-contains journal/2026-11-12.md|# Thursday, 12 November 2026
shot v1.17-journal-entries
tap-on CalPrevEntry
expect-open journal/2026-11-05.md
tap-on CalPrevEntry
expect-open journal/2026-11-02.md
tap-on CalNextEntry
expect-open journal/2026-11-05.md
# Another month, and back to today.
tap-on CalPrevMonth
shot v1.17-journal-october
tap-on CalNextMonth
tap-on CalNextMonth
tap-on CalToday
expect-open journal/2026-11-02.md
# Tapping a day that has a note opens it without touching it.
tap-on Day:2026-11-05
expect-open journal/2026-11-05.md
expect-file-contains journal/2026-11-05.md|# Thursday, 5 November 2026
# Settings -> Journal: the notes follow the layout.
tap-on Options
tap-on Folder layout/Year and week
expect-file journal/2026/W45/2026-11-02.md
expect-file journal/2026/W45/2026-11-05.md
expect-no-file journal/2026-11-02.md
shot v1.17-journal-layout-week
tap-on Folder layout/One folder
expect-file journal/2026-11-02.md
expect-no-file journal/2026/W45/2026-11-02.md
tap-on Close
shot v1.17-journal-back
